fork-linux (1.0.3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Open in lists host IDEs on PATH (VS Code, Cursor, IntelliJ, …) via
    fl-launch stubs and fork-linux-host run; host_integration rev 4.
  * repo fix/undo default to every repository Fork knows (core.filemode /
    skip-worktree) so Stage All and file diffs work under Wine.
  * Not affiliated with Fork's developers; buy Fork at https://git-fork.com/buy.

